<span id="S4.T4.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">PG-Video-LLaVA</span>,
and <span id="S4.T4.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Video-LLaMA</span>.
Mode describes prompt type (see Section <a href="#S3.SS3" title="3.3 Prompt Design ‣ 3 Datasets, Models, Prompt Design and Metrics ‣ Enhancing the Learning Experience: Using Vision-Language Models to Generate Questions for Educational Videos" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.3</span></a>), where <span id="S4.T4.16" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Avg.</span> is the average result. <span id="S4.T4.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Quest.</span>, <span id="S4.T4.18" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Statem.</span>, and <span id="S4.T4.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Empty</span> denote the percentage of generated questions, statements, and empty outputs, respectively. Besides, the scores of the metrics <span id="S4.T4.20" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Rouge</span>, <span id="S4.T4.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">BertScore</span> and our metric (ICD) are given.</figcaption>
